    <main>
      <h1>{{ t('Methodology', '方法论') }}</h1>
      <p class="lead muted">{{ t('How the Factor Lab, Thematic Baskets and Seasonality pages are built — every formula, lookback and honest limit, on FREE public data (SEC EDGAR + a ~3-year S&P-1500 price cache + the Ken French library). Read this first; it is what makes the numbers interpretable rather than impressive.',
        '因子实验室、主题篮子与季节性页面的构建方式 — 每个公式、回看窗口与诚实的局限，全部基于免费公开数据（SEC EDGAR + 约 3 年标普 1500 价格缓存 + Ken French 库）。先读这里。') }}</p>
